n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">下降；减少；下跌；击倒；打倒；被击倒；被打倒；因病、疲劳等而无法行动；卧病（如感冒等）；醉倒；昏倒；倒下；（计算机系统、服务器等）宕机；崩溃；出局数；落后；处于下风；得分少；（美式橄榄球）进攻机会；绒毛；羽绒服</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"2287405\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>風邪<rp>(</rp><rt>かぜ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でダウンした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She came down with a cold.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">打開</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">打破僵局；突破困境</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"191645\">われわれは<ruby>局面<rp>(</rp><rt>きょくめん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>打開<rp>(</rp><rt>だかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>図<rp>(</rp><rt>はか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らなくてはならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">We must try to break the deadlock.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n1:v:妥協\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">妥協</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だきょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">妥协</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>品質<rp>(</rp><rt>ひんしつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>については<ruby>一切<rp>(</rp><rt>いっさい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>妥協<rp>(</rp><rt>だきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">在质量上绝不妥协。</span><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n1/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">妥</a></span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">妥結</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だけつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">达成协议；解决</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">打撃</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だげき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">打击；冲击；撞击；损害；击球；打击</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207950\">その<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らせは<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にとって<ruby>打撃<rp>(</rp><rt>だげき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The news was a blow to him.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">駄作</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ださく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">劣作；拙作；垃圾作品</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">脱出</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だっしゅつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">逃脱；逃出；脱离；脱垂；脱出</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"208217\">その<ruby>脱出<rp>(</rp><rt>だっしゅつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>全<rp>(</rp><rt>まった</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く<ruby>奇跡<rp>(</rp><rt>きせき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>他<rp>(</rp><rt>ほか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ならなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The escape was nothing less than a miracle.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">脱する</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だっする</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅲ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅲ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">逃脱；脱离</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">脱退</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だったい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">退出；脱离；退会</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"177042\"><ruby>君<rp>(</rp><rt>きみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>直<rp>(</rp><rt>ただ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちにクラブを<ruby>脱退<rp>(</rp><rt>だったい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>したほうがよい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You may as well withdraw from the club right away.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">妥当</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だとう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">妥当</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n1/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">妥</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">だぶだぶ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">宽松；肥大；松弛；下垂；溅洒；泼溅；溢出；（液体）充裕地；大量地浸泡（如浸在酱汁中）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"92147\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はだぶだぶの<ruby>上着<rp>(</rp><rt>うわぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>着<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She&#x27;s wearing a loose coat.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ダブる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">重复；重叠；重叠；撞期；同时发生；留级；重修（不及格的课程或学年）；完成双杀；双误（网球）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"170291\"><ruby>祭日<rp>(</rp><rt>さいじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>日曜<rp>(</rp><rt>にちよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にダブると<ruby>月曜<rp>(</rp><rt>げつよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>休<rp>(</rp><rt>やす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みになる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">When a holiday falls on Sunday, we have an extra holiday on Monday.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">だらけ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">充满；到处都是；满是（如错误）；被...覆盖；沾满（血、泥等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"206955\">その<ruby>部屋<rp>(</rp><rt>へや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>紙<rp>(</rp><rt>かみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くずだらけだった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The room was littered with scraps of paper.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">怠い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だるい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">倦怠；无力；慵懒；沉重；烦人；讨厌；麻烦</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"203252\">だるいし<ruby>頭<rp>(</rp><rt>あたま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がずきずきする。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I feel listless and have a throbbing headache.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">壇</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">讲台；讲坛；演讲台；坛；土坛；界；圈子；曼荼罗</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">団結</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だんけつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">团结；联合；团队精神；结合；抱团；联手</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"235548\">２つのグループが<ruby>団結<rp>(</rp><rt>だんけつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して１つの<ruby>政党<rp>(</rp><rt>せいとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Two groups united to form a party.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">断言</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だんげん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">断言；声言；宣称</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"154492\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>潔白<rp>(</rp><rt>けっぱく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だと<ruby>断言<rp>(</rp><rt>だんげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I affirmed that he was innocent.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">断然</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だんぜん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">坚定地；断然地；果断地；绝对地；肯定地；绝对地；断然地（表示错误、差异等）；远远地；遥遥领先地；毫无疑问地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"92952\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はクラスの<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で、<ruby>断然<rp>(</rp><rt>だんぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>歌<rp>(</rp><rt>うた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がいちばんうまかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She was by far the best singer in the class.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">旦那</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">だんな</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">家主；店主；丈夫；先生；老板；老爷（对男顾客或地位高者的称呼）；情妇、艺妓、酒吧或夜总会女招待的金主；包养者；干爹；施舍；布施；施主</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"127374\"><ruby>旦那<rp>(</rp><rt>だんな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>子供<rp>(</rp><rt>こども</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>引<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>権<rp>(</rp><rt>けん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>望<rp>(</rp><rt>のぞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでいた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Her husband also wanted custody of the children.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ダンプ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">倾倒；倾卸；转储；自卸卡车</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"76569\">ダンプカーと<ruby>正面衝突<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうめんしょうとつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>したタクシーはぐしゃぐしゃになった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The taxi collided head-on with a dump truck and was badly crushed.</span></div></li>"]